<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Protect your system" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Protect your system</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Prevent circuit breaker closure when voltage parameters are outside prescribed limits. Protect your equipment and personnel while minimizing risks from grid instability.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Improve stability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Improve stability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Precisely control circuit breaker closing and synchronization. Integrate into complex grid systems to improve stability and efficiency while delivering reliable power flow.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Access data and insights" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Access data and insights</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Access instrumentation, fault data and integrated input/output logic. Use data logging and fault reports to draw comprehensive insights and make informed decisions for proactive maintenance.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='fGII9zgKIC1PhQPahYODs' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='fGII9zgKIC1PhQPahYODs'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-fGII9zgKIC1PhQPahYODs" class="Ca